Which low-latency runtimes this backend can drive on the live device;
the Reflex* entries above route to the one LowLatency::ActiveBackend
picks.

Self-driven frame cycle for a window this viewport owns. BeginFrame
acquires an image and opens the command buffer; EndFrame closes it;
Present submits against this viewport's own sync objects and presents.

Layer-side synchronization validation (hazard detection) — catches
missing/wrong barriers deterministically at record time. Slow;
meant for GPU self-tests. Only effective when EnableValidation.

Same rolling hash the Vulkan loader always used: per-stage seed mix,
then the blob folded in 32-bit words (shader blobs are word-aligned;
a trailing remainder folds byte-wise).
